{% endif %}## Install

```sh
curl -fsSLo ~/.config/qutebrowser/acid-acetic.py \
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/acid-theme/qutebrowser/main/acid-acetic.py
```

Then source it from `config.py`, which runs it with `c` already bound:

```python
config.source("acid-acetic.py")
```

